@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+---
+"haulers-dream": patch
+---
+
+Repair unfinished items bound to bills that have no workbench stack after loading, preserving their ingredients and work progress. Clean up affected saved crafting jobs through normal job cancellation so pawns can select valid work. The unfinished-item repair is adapted from flixzf's contribution in PR #148.
